* Do you have the right to work in aged care?

Language:

* Cantonese and Mandarin (Required)

Licence/Certification:

* AHPRA Nursing Registration (Preferred)
* First Aid Certificate (Preferred)
* Police Check (Preferred)

Work Authorisation:

* Australia (Required)

